{"title":"P6566 - P6566 [NOI Online","slug":"2026-05-27-P6566-P6566-NOI-Online-3-入门组-观星-洛谷","date":"2026-05-26T16:00:00.000Z","updated":"2026-05-27T09:47:39.175Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2026-05-27-P6566-P6566-NOI-Online-3-入门组-观星-洛谷.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-P6566-观星-DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P6566-观星-DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P6566] 观星 + DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\"></a>[洛谷 P6566] 观星 + DFS深度优先搜索应用详解</h2><h3 id=\"1-题目概览\"><a href=\"#1-题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 题目概览\"></a>1. 题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P6566\">洛谷 P6566</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 图论、DFS、连通块</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 网格连通块搜索、DFS算法、数据分组统计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意解析\"><a href=\"#2-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意解析\"></a>2. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 给定一个由星星 <code>*</code> 和空地 <code>.</code> 组成的网格，星星通过 8 个方向相邻形成星座。需要找到所有星座，并统计每个星座的星星数量。然后，将这些星座按大小分组，求出不同大小的组数（星系数量）和最大星系的大小。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 第一行包含两个整数 (N) 和 (M)，表示网格的行数和列数。接下来 (N) 行，每行包含 (M) 个字符，表示网格内容。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 两个整数，分别表示星系的数量和最大星系的大小。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.**.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>输出:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 4</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>解释: 网格中有三个星座，最大的星座包含 4 个星星。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#3-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>3. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"3-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#3-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.1 问题分析\"></a>3.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>本题的核心在于找到所有星座并统计其大小，然后对这些大小进行分组。</li>\n<li>星座是由星星通过 8 个方向相连形成的，因此可以使用 DFS 或 BFS 来搜索连通块。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#3-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.2 算法原理\"></a>3.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 使用 DFS 遍历每个星星，如果星星未被访问过，则从该星星开始搜索所有相邻的星星，并计数。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用显式栈来模拟递归的 DFS，避免递归深度过大导致的栈溢出问题。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 选择 DFS 是因为它能够深度优先地搜索连通块，适合本题的网格搜索问题。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 通过 DFS 搜索每个连通块（星座），并统计其大小，然后使用字典来统计不同大小星座的出现次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-3-代码详解\"><a href=\"#3-3-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.3 代码详解\"></a>3.3 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    N = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    M = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    grid = data[<span class=\"number\">2</span>:]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    visited = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * M <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    directions = [(-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">                  (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>),           (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">                  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>),  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>),  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    size_count = &#123;&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(M):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[i][j] == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[i][j]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                stack = [(i, j)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                visited[i][j] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                cnt = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> stack:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    x, y = stack.pop()</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    cnt += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> dx, dy <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> directions:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        nx, ny = x + dx, y + dy</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= nx &lt; N <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= ny &lt; M:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[nx][ny] == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[nx][ny]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                visited[nx][ny] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                                stack.append((nx, ny))</span><br><span class=\"line\">                size_count[cnt] = size_count.get(cnt, <span class=\"number\">0</span>) + <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    num_galaxies = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(size_count)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    max_galaxy_size = <span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(sz * cnt <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> sz, cnt <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> size_count.items())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(num_galaxies, max_galaxy_size)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"3-4-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#3-4-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.4 优化技巧\"></a>3.4 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用显式栈来模拟递归的 DFS，避免栈溢出。</li>\n<li>使用字典来统计不同大小星座的出现次数，方便后续计算星系数量和最大星系大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#4-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 复杂度分析\"></a>4. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: (O(NM))，每个格子最多被访问一次，每次访问检查 8 个方向。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: (O(NM))，<code>visited</code> 数组和栈大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#5-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 输入输出示例\"></a>5. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.**.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 4</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#6-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>6. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忘记初始化 <code>visited</code> 数组，导致重复搜索。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用打印语句输出搜索过程，检查 <code>visited</code> 数组的状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#7-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 总结与扩展\"></a>7. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会使用 DFS 搜索网格连通块，并使用字典进行数据分组统计。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此题的思路应用于其他需要搜索连通块的问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的网格搜索算法，例如并查集或线段树。</li>\n</ul>\n","more":"<p>&lt;博客&gt;</p>\n<h2 id=\"洛谷-P6566-观星-DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\"><a href=\"#洛谷-P6566-观星-DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"[洛谷 P6566] 观星 + DFS深度优先搜索应用详解\"></a>[洛谷 P6566] 观星 + DFS深度优先搜索应用详解</h2><h3 id=\"1-题目概览\"><a href=\"#1-题目概览\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 题目概览\"></a>1. 题目概览</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>题目来源</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P6566\">洛谷 P6566</a></li>\n<li><strong>题目难度</strong>: ★★★☆☆</li>\n<li><strong>标签分类</strong>: 图论、DFS、连通块</li>\n<li><strong>核心考点</strong>: 网格连通块搜索、DFS算法、数据分组统计</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-题意解析\"><a href=\"#2-题意解析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 题意解析\"></a>2. 题意解析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>问题描述</strong>: 给定一个由星星 <code>*</code> 和空地 <code>.</code> 组成的网格，星星通过 8 个方向相邻形成星座。需要找到所有星座，并统计每个星座的星星数量。然后，将这些星座按大小分组，求出不同大小的组数（星系数量）和最大星系的大小。</li>\n<li><strong>输入格式</strong>: 第一行包含两个整数 (N) 和 (M)，表示网格的行数和列数。接下来 (N) 行，每行包含 (M) 个字符，表示网格内容。</li>\n<li><strong>输出格式</strong>: 两个整数，分别表示星系的数量和最大星系的大小。</li>\n<li><strong>样例分析</strong>:<ul>\n<li>输入:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.**.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>输出:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 4</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>解释: 网格中有三个星座，最大的星座包含 4 个星星。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"3-算法思路（核心部分）\"><a href=\"#3-算法思路（核心部分）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 算法思路（核心部分）\"></a>3. 算法思路（核心部分）</h3><h4 id=\"3-1-问题分析\"><a href=\"#3-1-问题分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.1 问题分析\"></a>3.1 问题分析</h4><ul>\n<li>本题的核心在于找到所有星座并统计其大小，然后对这些大小进行分组。</li>\n<li>星座是由星星通过 8 个方向相连形成的，因此可以使用 DFS 或 BFS 来搜索连通块。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-2-算法原理\"><a href=\"#3-2-算法原理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.2 算法原理\"></a>3.2 算法原理</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>朴素思路</strong>: 使用 DFS 遍历每个星星，如果星星未被访问过，则从该星星开始搜索所有相邻的星星，并计数。</li>\n<li><strong>优化路径</strong>: 使用显式栈来模拟递归的 DFS，避免递归深度过大导致的栈溢出问题。</li>\n<li><strong>算法选择</strong>: 选择 DFS 是因为它能够深度优先地搜索连通块，适合本题的网格搜索问题。</li>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>: 通过 DFS 搜索每个连通块（星座），并统计其大小，然后使用字典来统计不同大小星座的出现次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"3-3-代码详解\"><a href=\"#3-3-代码详解\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.3 代码详解\"></a>3.3 代码详解</h4><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">solve</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = sys.stdin.read().split()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    N = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">0</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    M = <span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(data[<span class=\"number\">1</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    grid = data[<span class=\"number\">2</span>:]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    visited = [[<span class=\"literal\">False</span>] * M <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> _ <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    directions = [(-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>), (-<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">                  (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>),           (<span class=\"number\">0</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>),</span><br><span class=\"line\">                  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, -<span class=\"number\">1</span>),  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">0</span>),  (<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">1</span>)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    size_count = &#123;&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(N):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> j <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(M):</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[i][j] == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[i][j]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                stack = [(i, j)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                visited[i][j] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                cnt = <span class=\"number\">0</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                <span class=\"keyword\">while</span> stack:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    x, y = stack.pop()</span><br><span class=\"line\">                    cnt += <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> dx, dy <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> directions:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        nx, ny = x + dx, y + dy</span><br><span class=\"line\">                        <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= nx &lt; N <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span> &lt;= ny &lt; M:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                            <span class=\"keyword\">if</span> grid[nx][ny] == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span> <span class=\"keyword\">and</span> <span class=\"keyword\">not</span> visited[nx][ny]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                visited[nx][ny] = <span class=\"literal\">True</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                                stack.append((nx, ny))</span><br><span class=\"line\">                size_count[cnt] = size_count.get(cnt, <span class=\"number\">0</span>) + <span class=\"number\">1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    num_galaxies = <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(size_count)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    max_galaxy_size = <span class=\"built_in\">max</span>(sz * cnt <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> sz, cnt <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> size_count.items())</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(num_galaxies, max_galaxy_size)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h4 id=\"3-4-优化技巧\"><a href=\"#3-4-优化技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.4 优化技巧\"></a>3.4 优化技巧</h4><ul>\n<li>使用显式栈来模拟递归的 DFS，避免栈溢出。</li>\n<li>使用字典来统计不同大小星座的出现次数，方便后续计算星系数量和最大星系大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-复杂度分析\"><a href=\"#4-复杂度分析\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 复杂度分析\"></a>4. 复杂度分析</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>时间复杂度</strong>: (O(NM))，每个格子最多被访问一次，每次访问检查 8 个方向。</li>\n<li><strong>空间复杂度</strong>: (O(NM))，<code>visited</code> 数组和栈大小。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5-输入输出示例\"><a href=\"#5-输入输出示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 输入输出示例\"></a>5. 输入输出示例</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>样例输入</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 3</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.**.</span><br><span class=\"line\">.*.*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li><strong>样例输出</strong>:<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">3 4</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"6-常见错误与调试技巧\"><a href=\"#6-常见错误与调试技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"6. 常见错误与调试技巧\"></a>6. 常见错误与调试技巧</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>易错点</strong>: 忘记初始化 <code>visited</code> 数组，导致重复搜索。</li>\n<li><strong>调试方法</strong>: 使用打印语句输出搜索过程，检查 <code>visited</code> 数组的状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"7-总结与扩展\"><a href=\"#7-总结与扩展\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"7. 总结与扩展\"></a>7. 总结与扩展</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>核心收获</strong>: 学会使用 DFS 搜索网格连通块，并使用字典进行数据分组统计。</li>\n<li><strong>举一反三</strong>: 可以将此题的思路应用于其他需要搜索连通块的问题。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶方向</strong>: 研究更高效的网格搜索算法，例如并查集或线段树。</li>\n</ul>\n","categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"蓝桥杯","path":"api/tags/蓝桥杯.json"},{"name":"算法题解","path":"api/tags/算法题解.json"},{"name":"P6566","path":"api/tags/P6566.json"}]}